The unmodified files and their original notices are in vendor/foo2zjs.
The exact upstream revision and hashes are in vendor/UPSTREAM.txt and
vendor/SHA256SUMS. src/job.h adapts the foo2zjs P1102 job framing; project-specific
adaptation dated 2026-10-01. No claim of exclusive authorship over this code.

The installer includes matching complete source, dependencies, tests and build
and installation scripts in /Library/Printers/P1102Native/Source.tar.gz.
The source archive is also distributed alongside each release installer.
No proprietary HP executable, firmware, manual, logo, font or SDK is included.
macOS libraries and frameworks are supplied by the operating system, not this
package. Measured compatibility data is described in tests/TONE_REFERENCE.md.

